.IP \(bu
resman_cpu_eligible_users_count \- Users eligible under CPU policy
.IP \(bu
resman_ram_eligible_users_count \- Users eligible under RAM policy
.IP \(bu
resman_io_eligible_users_count \- Users eligible under I/O policy
