.IP \(bu
resman_user_cpu_usage_ema_percent{uid, username} \- Exponential moving average of CPU usage per user
.IP \(bu
resman_user_memory_usage_bytes{uid, username} \- Memory usage per user (PSS in bytes, RSS fallback)
.IP \(bu
resman_user_io_read_bytes_total{uid, username} \- Bytes read from block devices per user (when IO limits enabled)
.IP \(bu
resman_user_io_write_bytes_total{uid, username} \- Bytes written to block devices per user
.IP \(bu
resman_user_io_read_ops_total{uid, username} \- Read-family syscall count from /proc/PID/io syscr per user; this is not block-device IOPS
.IP \(bu
resman_user_io_write_ops_total{uid, username} \- Write-family syscall count from /proc/PID/io syscw per user; this is not block-device IOPS
.IP \(bu
resman_user_process_count{uid, username} \- Number of processes per user
